+  /**
+   * 内容开关 (server/mod/toggle.js, docs/MOD-RHODES.md §开关): tell EVERY connected session that a data mod was
+   * switched — rooms and title screens alike. It is not a room broadcast: the browser fetched /data/*.json once for
